flowchart TD
    BEGIN[Begin Node: Read Input] --> ROUTE{Categorize Node}
    ROUTE -->|Doc Query| RETRIEVE[Retrieval Node: Hybrid Search]
    ROUTE -->|Database Query| SQL[ExeSQL Node: Run Query]
    ROUTE -->|General Chat| PROMPT[Generate Node]

    RETRIEVE --> LLM[LLM Node: Synthesize Response]
    SQL --> LLM
    PROMPT --> LLM

    LLM --> SWITCH{Switch Node: Check Quality}
    SWITCH -->|Sufficient| ANSWER[Answer Node: Stream Output]
    SWITCH -->|Insufficient| REWRITE[Rewrite Question Node]
    REWRITE --> RETRIEVE
